        "operationId": "adobeStockSuggest",
        "summary": "Adobe Stock search suggestions",
        "description": "Keyword suggestions the Adobe Stock search box shows for a partial query (up to 10), with their weight.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/adobe-stock-suggest",
